.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH maildir 1  "maildir " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
maildir \- Maildir\-specific API
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBmaildir\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Maildir\-specific API.
.PP
This command gives you access to the raw Maildir API.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
maildir\-create(1)
Create a Maildir folder
.TP
maildir\-rename(1)
Rename a Maildir folder
.TP
maildir\-delete(1)
Delete a Maildir folder
.TP
maildir\-list(1)
List Maildir folders
.TP
maildir\-messages(1)
Manage MAILDIR messages
.TP
maildir\-flags(1)
Manage MAILDIR flags
.TP
maildir\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
